name:攻方队伍头像'刷新
lines:
List playerList=act 1101./弹幕.UI'得到上方玩家表()
Float playerAmount=varf List.playerList.count()
Float index=fun create.float(Float 0)
while{fun float.lt(var index:var playerAmount)
  Struct player=varf List.playerList.readStruct(var index)
  String uid=varf Struct.player.getString(String id:Bool 1)
  Mech obj=varf Dict.攻方炮塔记录.readMech(var uid:Bool 0)
  Vector3 坐标=act 1101.this.攻方队伍头像'坐标计算(var index)
  varf Mech.obj.move(var 坐标:Enum 0)
  varf Float.index.addEqual(Float 1)
}
endcode